  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The NEXUS Approach to Transformative Climate Resilience, Peace and Human Mobility in BARMM</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In the nascent Bangsamoro Autonomous Region in Muslim Mindanao (BARMM), where the region continues to face horizontal conflicts and has high prevalence of irregular and risky migration, the impact of climate change is more far-reaching and often threatens peace, security and human mobility. IOM proposes initiatives that contribute to long term solutions for Bangsamoro communities most affected by climate change, recognizing the intricate relationships between climate risks, conflict and security risks, and trafficking.  IOM seeks to strengthening governance mechanisms and planning that tackle this triple nexus, and improving capacities, both knowledge and socioeconomic opportunities, at the community level.</narrative>
  </description>
